<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">- Lamma 2Yɔh Sẽkoo e ziti e</book>
  <para style="h">2 Yɔhana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yɔhana Sẽkoo Au pɛsi Beenɛyɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Yɔhana</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Yɔh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sẽkoo a</para>
  <para style="mt1">YƆHANA pɛsi beenɛyɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Yɔhana sẽkoo e ziti</char> sipɛ &lt;&lt;shɔ yupɛ̃ni&gt;&gt;wɔɔ beerɛ yɛnɛ &lt;&lt;u shɔbi Jasu wɔ a ɓɛjaani,&gt;&gt;wɔɔ ɓa tasinɛ yɛ ɔ̃pɛ jaa wɛrɛ Ɗa wɔɔ au jadoyi. Jaa ruutɔ̃vɨng-mi sipɛ gakinɛ a yusho gɔ̃nɛ aru shomala nyayeelinɛ ai vimatinɛni.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ (1-3)</para>
  <para style="io1">shɔgbete i gaa ɔrinɛyɛ (4-6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yusho gɔ̃nɛ aru vimatinɛ nyayeelinɛ (7-11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyayisinɛ (12-13)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Sẽkoom shɛ a Yɔhana naa shɔpɛ̃ni sisɨn ãnɛ yɛnɛ suwɛrɛ gbete Ɗalapa lɔyɛ au jaayini, ang ɔrɔɔtɔ nizɛ, ɓa nkɔng ɔrɔɔrɛ sheeli ɓa, ama shɔgbete i zɛ ruu tɔ̃vɨn tɛ piti i ɔrɔɔtɔ. <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />N ɔrɔɔ aru tɔ̃vɨn gbete ang sisɨn ukɔ pɔ̃urɛ u ɔrɔɔrɛ, yɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃ntɔ a ukɔni dangdang.<verse eid="2JN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />Mɛnɛ tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ, raantanɛ, a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni au shɛ a Ɗalapa u Ɗa naa, a Yesɔ Kirisi Da ɓɛɛ jaa, u ɔ̃ u ɓɛɛkɔ a ɓuzɨn tɔ̃vɨn a ɔrinɛ.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tɔ̃vɨn a Ɔrinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />N nta sisɨn purutɔ fɛ̃ɛm ang zɛrɛ gãsi mɛɛ jaayi ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn, nogbete Da ãsiunyayɛ. <verse eid="2JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />Dɔdɔrim n gakaatɔ, n shɔ ɔrinɛ suwɛrɛː u piti u ɔri zɔtɔ. N ji ɓee ɓa nyaãsinɛ sɔɔ ɓa; ji nyaãsinɛ gbete au gaa ntanɛ a ɗekɨn yɛ. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Ɔrinɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ pɛlinɛ vigbete Ɗalapa ãsinya nɛu pɛliyɛ. Nya-ãsinɛ gbete ɔ gaa ntanɛ a ɗekɨn, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ ɔ ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ zɔ ɔrinɛ.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />N sha vim aru shɔshɔɗakinɛyi waanɛ i sãtitɛ a kopiɗɔpiya a kotipi, shɔ gbeteyi kasi ɓa nɛ Yesɔ Kirisi a kotipi a bishɔzɛ ɓa. Zɔng shɔ ɗɔmiyi pɛ shɔshɔɗakinɛ a Kirisi shɔnɔpɔ̃. <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />Ɔ kɔyuutɔ, aru vishonɛ gbete ɔ pɛli Ɗalapa yɛ ɔ̃rɛ waatɛ, ama ɔ yɛ kpaa ɔ nazã tɔ kpai.<verse eid="2JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Shɔ gbete ji shi ɓa ayuu Kirisi vimatinɛ ɓa, ama kɛ pɔ̃ viwɔnɛ au yuuni, u Ɗalapa ɓa sisɨn ni ɓa. Shɔ gbete kɛ shinɛ jo ayuu Kirisi vimatinɛ sheeli, i yɛ ɓassiyuutɔ a Ɗalapa a ɓɛɛ jaani. <verse eid="2JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Naa shɔwɔɔ kaanɛ kɛ matinɛ viwɔɔ totti aa ɗɔbii, mɔkaa tɛunaanɛ aa wɛrɛni; mokaa geeunya nɛ, naa shɔ Ɗalapa gɨnnɛ. <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />Aruviya shɔ gbeteu kɛ geeyi nyanɛ, ɓassiyutɛ a vikɔ̃linɛ ayi pɛliyɛni.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyakonɛ Au Kunaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />N vi gbete n kasɔɔ gelinɛ aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm, ama n ji kasɔɔ beerinɛ ɓa a sẽkoo ɓa; nɔgbete n si pɛli nam, n pɔ̃ a sisɨn n yɛn yɛwɔ ɗɔbiitɔ u nwanya u ɗɔgbete u zɛ zɔyɛ, aruviya u nta sisɨn puru kɛkn fɛ̃ɛm.<verse eid="2JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Mɛnau ɓɛɛ jaayi a Ɗalapa lɔyɛ i gee a nyatɛ.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>